<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts disk drive makers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts disk drive makers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers intiated coverage of several computer disk drive makers, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Lehman started Western Digital Corp and Quantum Corp as a buy, sources said.</p>
<p>-- started Seagate Technology Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
